ADMIN PANEL PLATFORM REPORTING
==============================

Purpose
-------
Platform Reporting is an admin-side dynamic reporting screen that lets the team analyze ad performance by combining:

- date range
- device/environment
- timezone
- metrics
- advertiser-side filters
- publisher-side filters
- grouping dimensions

The page is available from:
- Reports -> Platform Reporting

URL
---
- admin/reports/platform_report

Allowed roles
-------------
- ADMIN
- MANAGER

Main function
-------------
This page allows the admin or manager to build a custom cross-entity report table for ad-serving performance.

It can report data using metrics like:
- Request
- Impression
- Click
- Conversion
- Spend
- Revenue
- Profit
- CTR
- ECPM
- ERPM
- EPPM
- Fill Rate

It can group the result by dimensions like:
- Advertiser
- Campaign
- Creative
- Publisher
- Site
- Adblock
- Country
- Adsize
- Revenue Type
- Date

Display interval options are:
- CUMULATIVE
- HOUR
- MONTH

