Simple summary
--------------
Platform Reporting on the admin panel is a configurable server-side DataTables report.
The UI is built in the chart widget, run() sends filter state to fetch_platform_stats(), the admin controller forwards the request to api/v1/report/fetch, fetch_post() builds the shared reporting request, do_report->fetch() generates the SQL and result set, and generate_zip() reuses the same flow for Excel export.
